{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2018-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1528416000, "end_date": 1529107199, "month_true_total": 557, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:08:32 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42746956", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162868852", "personaname": "Zmuz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198162868852/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 105634, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 43268, "last_played": 1686793766, "avatar": "77d81211a6f7f78aa8e07435e919b582cdb63ba5"}, "language": "english", "review": "I tried it once or twice, it's okay i guess.", "timestamp_created": 1529084167, "timestamp_updated": 1529084167, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42746582", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994449704", "personaname": "E.Volf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MFVOLF/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 104176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32608, "last_played": 1761694650, "avatar": "813f85a902abde831c88cc489db5fdf9855965b0"}, "language": "english", "review": "To lazy to type a complex review so to keep it simple \n\nA great game for people who love a sandbox military simulation, I know friends who has hundreds of hours in this game because how addictive it is.\nThere are so many endless scenarios you can create with the eden editor or with the in game editor zeus.\nIf you think you can pick this game up without playing any of the Arma series or any military sims because you played battlefield. You wont, you will have some trouble doing some things, its best to watch some tutorial videos on the game before buying if you like it or not. \n", "timestamp_created": 1529082819, "timestamp_updated": 1529082819, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.561752974987030029", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42746068", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073114329", "personaname": "Dev_Lowe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SniperEliteStealthMaster/", "num_games_owned": 274, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 143640, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 89599, "last_played": 1774258687, "avatar": "73ccb952507faa3bc80c7eace7562c1a9915f06c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Look past all the jank and bugs, I've launched a tank 50 foot in the air moving 2 kmh and bumping into a rock. I've been shot through walls by snapshot AI who have a higher sensitivity than humanly posible. I've died countless time by simply trying to jump over something and falling to my death from 2 feet up. Yet I can still say this is the most immersive simulator to date.  This is hands down the best millitary FPS on the market. After 80$ worth of DLC the game actually seems refreshed from the original launch. As if they actually put alot of work into optimizing the new features. If you're thinking of buying this game I have one question for you. Have you ever been transporting hundrends of virtual cocaine in a semi truck only to be ambushed by 5 guys in a armored offroad quilin? Through the odds you eject out of the semi truck with great speed and light them up with the 30 round mag of 9 mm, securing your cocaine and honor. If not, this may be the game for you. Highly reccomended will kill for money again. 10/10. 2013 to infinity.", "timestamp_created": 1529081006, "timestamp_updated": 1669836172, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42745379", "author": {"steamid": "76561198400890634", "personaname": "大马猴", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198400890634/", "num_games_owned": 33, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 86541, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42069, "last_played": 1765976544, "avatar": "51eaf99db4d6809816585d859e1454d522c3f6ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "感觉不错。游戏逼真有劲。", "timestamp_created": 1529079023, "timestamp_updated": 1720100227, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471014469861984253", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42743514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198814838369", "personaname": "SKOOONSKIE69", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198814838369/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 7367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4652, "last_played": 1739800128, "avatar": "5b64715adaa6aab5cd221cc1fac2eec74e5dbd6f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good Military Sandbox 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1529073447, "timestamp_updated": 1529073458, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969